    {
      "start_ms": 209120,
      "end_ms": 212799,
      "start": "00:03:29.120",
      "end": "00:03:32.799",
      "text": "look more like your gameplay. The next"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 211200,
      "end_ms": 216760,
      "start": "00:03:31.200",
      "end": "00:03:36.760",
      "text": "example is pretty similar. Let's watch"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 212799,
      "end_ms": 216760,
      "start": "00:03:32.799",
      "end": "00:03:36.760",
      "text": "it once and then break it down."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 220799,
      "end_ms": 225720,
      "start": "00:03:40.799",
      "end": "00:03:45.720",
      "text": "The objective is mine."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 229840,
      "end_ms": 233280,
      "start": "00:03:49.840",
      "end": "00:03:53.280",
      "text": "Clear the way. Hopefully now you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 232080,
      "end_ms": 235280,
      "start": "00:03:52.080",
      "end": "00:03:55.280",
      "text": "starting to see a little bit of what's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 233280,
      "end_ms": 237040,
      "start": "00:03:53.280",
      "end": "00:03:57.040",
      "text": "going on. The first outplay is the brig"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 235280,
      "end_ms": 238799,
      "start": "00:03:55.280",
      "end": "00:03:58.799",
      "text": "whip. This is a pretty common piece of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 237040,
      "end_ms": 240239,
      "start": "00:03:57.040",
      "end": "00:04:00.239",
      "text": "monkey tech, but just using your bubble"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 238799,
      "end_ms": 241760,
      "start": "00:03:58.799",
      "end": "00:04:01.760",
      "text": "to block the whip shot as you're jumping"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 240239,
      "end_ms": 245319,
      "start": "00:04:00.239",
      "end": "00:04:05.319",
      "text": "onto a piece of high ground is really"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 241760,
      "end_ms": 245319,
      "start": "00:04:01.760",
      "end": "00:04:05.319",
      "text": "important piece of tech."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 248239,
      "end_ms": 251040,
      "start": "00:04:08.239",
      "end": "00:04:11.040",
      "text": "He's able to get on high ground and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 249599,
      "end_ms": 252799,
      "start": "00:04:09.599",
      "end": "00:04:12.799",
      "text": "knock Trong off, which is really"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 251040,
      "end_ms": 254319,
      "start": "00:04:11.040",
      "end": "00:04:14.319",
      "text": "important. The second outplay comes on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 252799,
      "end_ms": 255920,
      "start": "00:04:12.799",
      "end": "00:04:15.920",
      "text": "the sleep dart. Dancing the side of the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 254319,
      "end_ms": 257680,
      "start": "00:04:14.319",
      "end": "00:04:17.680",
      "text": "bubble and keeping your eye on the Anna"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 255920,
      "end_ms": 260239,
      "start": "00:04:15.920",
      "end": "00:04:20.239",
      "text": "to see when he's walking into the bubble"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 257680,
      "end_ms": 262240,
      "start": "00:04:17.680",
      "end": "00:04:22.240",
      "text": "will allow you to dodge a sleeper."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 260239,
      "end_ms": 263840,
      "start": "00:04:20.239",
      "end": "00:04:23.840",
      "text": "Help me. Now, the next piece of outplay"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 262240,
      "end_ms": 265520,
      "start": "00:04:22.240",
      "end": "00:04:25.520",
      "text": "is a little bit less obvious, but I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 263840,
      "end_ms": 267440,
      "start": "00:04:23.840",
      "end": "00:04:27.440",
      "text": "mentioned it in the one before as well."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 265520,
      "end_ms": 268479,
      "start": "00:04:25.520",
      "end": "00:04:28.479",
      "text": "If you're trying to kill supports, the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 267440,
      "end_ms": 270720,
      "start": "00:04:27.440",
      "end": "00:04:30.720",
      "text": "biggest problem is that they'll heal"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 268479,
      "end_ms": 272479,
      "start": "00:04:28.479",
      "end": "00:04:32.479",
      "text": "each other. One of the most powerful and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 270720,
      "end_ms": 274240,
      "start": "00:04:30.720",
      "end": "00:04:34.240",
      "text": "least flashy things you can do to kill"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 272479,
      "end_ms": 275360,
      "start": "00:04:32.479",
      "end": "00:04:35.360",
      "text": "supports is just to fight them for a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 274240,
      "end_ms": 277280,
      "start": "00:04:34.240",
      "end": "00:04:37.280",
      "text": "long time and drain their healing"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 275360,
      "end_ms": 278639,
      "start": "00:04:35.360",
      "end": "00:04:38.639",
      "text": "resources. Here, Trong's already given a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 277280,
      "end_ms": 280639,
      "start": "00:04:37.280",
      "end": "00:04:40.639",
      "text": "pack to Shu on the first part of the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 278639,
      "end_ms": 283600,
      "start": "00:04:38.639",
      "end": "00:04:43.600",
      "text": "jump."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 280639,
      "end_ms": 285199,
      "start": "00:04:40.639",
      "end": "00:04:45.199",
      "text": "Here he has to give another one."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 283600,
      "end_ms": 287280,
      "start": "00:04:43.600",
      "end": "00:04:47.280",
      "text": "Here he has to give one to Lip. When you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 285199,
      "end_ms": 288560,
      "start": "00:04:45.199",
      "end": "00:04:48.560",
      "text": "fight supports for a long time after"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 287280,
      "end_ms": 290560,
      "start": "00:04:47.280",
      "end": "00:04:50.560",
      "text": "outplaying both of these cool downs,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 288560,
      "end_ms": 292240,
      "start": "00:04:48.560",
      "end": "00:04:52.240",
      "text": "just sit above them and zap them. They"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 290560,
      "end_ms": 294080,
      "start": "00:04:50.560",
      "end": "00:04:54.080",
      "text": "run out of healing. This is a small but"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 292240,
      "end_ms": 298360,
      "start": "00:04:52.240",
      "end": "00:04:58.360",
      "text": "important part that means Shu does not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 294080,
      "end_ms": 298360,
      "start": "00:04:54.080",
      "end": "00:04:58.360",
      "text": "get a pack here when he drops on him."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 299680,
      "end_ms": 304240,
      "start": "00:04:59.680",
      "end": "00:05:04.240",
      "text": "So, if you're watching a VOD, look for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 302080,
      "end_ms": 306320,
      "start": "00:05:02.080",
      "end": "00:05:06.320",
      "text": "this part. Dong Hack jumps on Shu here"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 304240,
      "end_ms": 308639,
      "start": "00:05:04.240",
      "end": "00:05:08.639",
      "text": "and kills him. That looks pretty easy,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 306320,
      "end_ms": 310000,
      "start": "00:05:06.320",
      "end": "00:05:10.000",
      "text": "you might say to yourself. Go back 20"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 308639,
      "end_ms": 312000,
      "start": "00:05:08.639",
      "end": "00:05:12.000",
      "text": "seconds and watch everything that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 310000,
      "end_ms": 313680,
      "start": "00:05:10.000",
      "end": "00:05:13.680",
      "text": "happened before, all the cool downs. How"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 312000,
      "end_ms": 315520,
      "start": "00:05:12.000",
      "end": "00:05:15.520",
      "text": "did they get outplayed? Because you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 313680,
      "end_ms": 317440,
      "start": "00:05:13.680",
      "end": "00:05:17.440",
      "text": "could do this part of it if you got to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 315520,
      "end_ms": 319360,
      "start": "00:05:15.520",
      "end": "00:05:19.360",
      "text": "here. Figuring out how you can get to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 317440,
      "end_ms": 320639,
      "start": "00:05:17.440",
      "end": "00:05:20.639",
      "text": "here is the important part. The last one"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 319360,
      "end_ms": 325240,
      "start": "00:05:19.360",
      "end": "00:05:25.240",
      "text": "from this map is a pretty similar"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 320639,
      "end_ms": 325240,
      "start": "00:05:20.639",
      "end": "00:05:25.240",
      "text": "backline kill. Let's just watch it."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 328000,
      "end_ms": 332280,
      "start": "00:05:28.000",
      "end": "00:05:32.280",
      "text": "You're fired up. Get in there."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 339840,
      "end_ms": 345639,
      "start": "00:05:39.840",
      "end": "00:05:45.639",
      "text": "First, he's just being patient and he"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 341360,
      "end_ms": 345639,
      "start": "00:05:41.360",
      "end": "00:05:45.639",
      "text": "waits for Shu to come out and throw Nit."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 346560,
      "end_ms": 349600,
      "start": "00:05:46.560",
      "end": "00:05:49.600",
      "text": "You don't have to do this, but Shu not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 348080,
      "end_ms": 352000,
      "start": "00:05:48.080",
      "end": "00:05:52.000",
      "text": "having Nade here in the room is pretty"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 349600,
      "end_ms": 353520,
      "start": "00:05:49.600",
      "end": "00:05:53.520",
      "text": "important. Next, instead of walking into"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 352000,
      "end_ms": 355360,
      "start": "00:05:52.000",
      "end": "00:05:55.360",
      "text": "the room, he's going to outplay the Brig"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 353520,
      "end_ms": 356800,
      "start": "00:05:53.520",
      "end": "00:05:56.800",
      "text": "by jumping over behind. The Brig's not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 355360,
      "end_ms": 358000,
      "start": "00:05:55.360",
      "end": "00:05:58.000",
      "text": "going to get a whip him away. It's going"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 356800,
      "end_ms": 359600,
      "start": "00:05:56.800",
      "end": "00:05:59.600",
      "text": "to be way harder to sleep him, and it's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 358000,
      "end_ms": 360800,
      "start": "00:05:58.000",
      "end": "00:06:00.800",
      "text": "just a better setup in general. After"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 359600,
      "end_ms": 362000,
      "start": "00:05:59.600",
      "end": "00:06:02.000",
      "text": "jumping and bubbling here, he's going to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 360800,
      "end_ms": 363520,
      "start": "00:06:00.800",
      "end": "00:06:03.520",
      "text": "do something we've seen him do a couple"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 362000,
      "end_ms": 365120,
      "start": "00:06:02.000",
      "end": "00:06:05.120",
      "text": "times already. He's going to keep his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 363520,
      "end_ms": 366800,
      "start": "00:06:03.520",
      "end": "00:06:06.800",
      "text": "eye on the Anna, and the second the Anna"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 365120,
      "end_ms": 368000,
      "start": "00:06:05.120",
      "end": "00:06:08.000",
      "text": "tries to walk into the bubble to sleep"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 366800,
      "end_ms": 369360,
      "start": "00:06:06.800",
      "end": "00:06:09.360",
      "text": "him, he's going to jump and boop the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 368000,
      "end_ms": 371039,
      "start": "00:06:08.000",
      "end": "00:06:11.039",
      "text": "Anna out of the bubble, mess up his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 369360,
      "end_ms": 375319,
      "start": "00:06:09.360",
      "end": "00:06:15.319",
      "text": "sleep."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 371039,
      "end_ms": 375319,
      "start": "00:06:11.039",
      "end": "00:06:15.319",
      "text": "You're powered up. Get in there."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 375840,
      "end_ms": 379039,
      "start": "00:06:15.840",
      "end": "00:06:19.039",
      "text": "Here on Runabi, we're going to see a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 377280,
      "end_ms": 380880,
      "start": "00:06:17.280",
      "end": "00:06:20.880",
      "text": "little bit of a different matchup. He's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 379039,
      "end_ms": 382479,
      "start": "00:06:19.039",
      "end": "00:06:22.479",
      "text": "playing Hazard into an Orisa comp that's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 380880,
      "end_ms": 383600,
      "start": "00:06:20.880",
      "end": "00:06:23.600",
      "text": "pretty difficult to dive. So, how are we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 382479,
      "end_ms": 385280,
      "start": "00:06:22.479",
      "end": "00:06:25.280",
      "text": "going to outplay these people on the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 383600,
      "end_ms": 386880,
      "start": "00:06:23.600",
      "end": "00:06:26.880",
      "text": "engage? The first part of outplaying"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 385280,
      "end_ms": 388800,
      "start": "00:06:25.280",
      "end": "00:06:28.800",
      "text": "people on Hazard is deciding how you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 386880,
      "end_ms": 390560,
      "start": "00:06:26.880",
      "end": "00:06:30.560",
      "text": "going to engage. A lot of players I know"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 388800,
      "end_ms": 391759,
      "start": "00:06:28.800",
      "end": "00:06:31.759",
      "text": "would just turn this corner, slash in,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 390560,
      "end_ms": 392720,
      "start": "00:06:30.560",
      "end": "00:06:32.720",
      "text": "and then after they die, they would"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 391759,
      "end_ms": 394080,
      "start": "00:06:31.759",
      "end": "00:06:34.080",
      "text": "complain they're not getting healed"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 392720,
      "end_ms": 396160,
      "start": "00:06:32.720",
      "end": "00:06:36.160",
      "text": "enough. What you're going to see Dong"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 394080,
      "end_ms": 398240,
      "start": "00:06:34.080",
      "end": "00:06:38.240",
      "text": "Hack do is climb over the wall, jump"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 396160,
      "end_ms": 401400,
      "start": "00:06:36.160",
      "end": "00:06:41.400",
      "text": "over the Orisa, and immediately get to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 398240,
      "end_ms": 401400,
      "start": "00:06:38.240",
      "end": "00:06:41.400",
      "text": "the backline."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 404639,
      "end_ms": 408160,
      "start": "00:06:44.639",
      "end": "00:06:48.160",
      "text": "After getting a slash on the bap, he's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 406240,
      "end_ms": 412360,
      "start": "00:06:46.240",
      "end": "00:06:52.360",
      "text": "going to use his wall to wall the TP off"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 408160,
      "end_ms": 412360,
      "start": "00:06:48.160",
      "end": "00:06:52.360",
      "text": "and stop Shu from tping out."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 419440,
      "end_ms": 423840,
      "start": "00:06:59.440",
      "end": "00:07:03.840",
      "text": "Doesn't look fun, does it? After this,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 421599,
      "end_ms": 425039,
      "start": "00:07:01.599",
      "end": "00:07:05.039",
      "text": "Dong Hack switches to ball. Here, we're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 423840,
      "end_ms": 427120,
      "start": "00:07:03.840",
      "end": "00:07:07.120",
      "text": "going to see him try and engage on the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 425039,
      "end_ms": 428800,
      "start": "00:07:05.039",
      "end": "00:07:08.800",
      "text": "cast Lucio Kiri backline. Instead of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 427120,
      "end_ms": 430560,
      "start": "00:07:07.120",
      "end": "00:07:10.560",
      "text": "Nade, Sleep, and Coach Gun, we're now"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 428800,
      "end_ms": 432479,
      "start": "00:07:08.800",
      "end": "00:07:12.479",
      "text": "trying to outplay Lucio Boop, Flashb"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 430560,
      "end_ms": 434080,
      "start": "00:07:10.560",
      "end": "00:07:14.080",
      "text": "Bang, and Suzu. Instead of having a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 432479,
      "end_ms": 436319,
      "start": "00:07:12.479",
      "end": "00:07:16.319",
      "text": "monkey bubble to outplay this, the tool"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 434080,
      "end_ms": 437599,
      "start": "00:07:14.080",
      "end": "00:07:17.599",
      "text": "we have on ball is a grapple. If you've"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 436319,
      "end_ms": 439039,
      "start": "00:07:16.319",
      "end": "00:07:19.039",
      "text": "learned anything from the previous"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 437599,
      "end_ms": 440560,
      "start": "00:07:17.599",
      "end": "00:07:20.560",
      "text": "fights, you'll realize that reaching for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 439039,
      "end_ms": 442639,
      "start": "00:07:19.039",
      "end": "00:07:22.639",
      "text": "these kills right away is going to be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 440560,
      "end_ms": 444000,
      "start": "00:07:20.560",
      "end": "00:07:24.000",
      "text": "pretty hard. Instead of grappling and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 442639,
      "end_ms": 445840,
      "start": "00:07:22.639",
      "end": "00:07:25.840",
      "text": "slamming, what we're going to do instead"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 444000,
      "end_ms": 447280,
      "start": "00:07:24.000",
      "end": "00:07:27.280",
      "text": "is grapple and spin around to take some"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 445840,
      "end_ms": 450000,
      "start": "00:07:25.840",
      "end": "00:07:30.000",
      "text": "visual attention and try to bait this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 447280,
      "end_ms": 451280,
      "start": "00:07:27.280",
      "end": "00:07:31.280",
      "text": "boop and this flashbang if we can. After"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 450000,
      "end_ms": 454639,
      "start": "00:07:30.000",
      "end": "00:07:34.639",
      "text": "doing that, we can slam and try and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 451280,
      "end_ms": 454639,
      "start": "00:07:31.280",
      "end": "00:07:34.639",
      "text": "reach for some kills."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 458880,
      "end_ms": 461840,
      "start": "00:07:38.880",
      "end": "00:07:41.840",
      "text": "Now, Chong does a really good job of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 460479,
      "end_ms": 463520,
      "start": "00:07:40.479",
      "end": "00:07:43.520",
      "text": "holding his boop here. So, the boop"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 461840,
      "end_ms": 465199,
      "start": "00:07:41.840",
      "end": "00:07:45.199",
      "text": "doesn't get outplayed. The lips flash"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 463520,
      "end_ms": 468360,
      "start": "00:07:43.520",
      "end": "00:07:48.360",
      "text": "does get outplayed here. Let's watch for"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 465199,
      "end_ms": 468360,
      "start": "00:07:45.199",
      "end": "00:07:48.360",
      "text": "Miss Pivia."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 468639,
      "end_ms": 471840,
      "start": "00:07:48.639",
      "end": "00:07:51.840",
      "text": "Bading. This flashbang keeps him alive."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 470240,
      "end_ms": 473199,
      "start": "00:07:50.240",
      "end": "00:07:53.199",
      "text": "And the three or so seconds of visual"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 471840,
      "end_ms": 475039,
      "start": "00:07:51.840",
      "end": "00:07:55.039",
      "text": "attention he takes just from grappling"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 473199,
      "end_ms": 476560,
      "start": "00:07:53.199",
      "end": "00:07:56.560",
      "text": "and spinning around allows Zest and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 475039,
      "end_ms": 480599,
      "start": "00:07:55.039",
      "end": "00:08:00.599",
      "text": "Proud to both get free angles on this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 476560,
      "end_ms": 480599,
      "start": "00:07:56.560",
      "end": "00:08:00.599",
      "text": "engage and start killing people."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 482560,
      "end_ms": 485520,
      "start": "00:08:02.560",
      "end": "00:08:05.520",
      "text": "After a bit, Lip is tired of getting his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 484240,
      "end_ms": 487840,
      "start": "00:08:04.240",
      "end": "00:08:07.840",
      "text": "flashing baited, and he switches to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 485520,
      "end_ms": 489280,
      "start": "00:08:05.520",
      "end": "00:08:09.280",
      "text": "Sombra. Now, the biggest outplayed tools"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 487840,
      "end_ms": 490639,
      "start": "00:08:07.840",
      "end": "00:08:10.639",
      "text": "are avoiding the Sombra hack, which you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 489280,
      "end_ms": 492560,
      "start": "00:08:09.280",
      "end": "00:08:12.560",
      "text": "can do just by shooting him if he tries"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 490639,
      "end_ms": 494479,
      "start": "00:08:10.639",
      "end": "00:08:14.479",
      "text": "to hack you, and outplaying the Lucio"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 492560,
      "end_ms": 495919,
      "start": "00:08:12.560",
      "end": "00:08:15.919",
      "text": "boop in the same way as before."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 494479,
      "end_ms": 497440,
      "start": "00:08:14.479",
      "end": "00:08:17.440",
      "text": "Unfortunately, grappling onto something"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 495919,
      "end_ms": 498800,
      "start": "00:08:15.919",
      "end": "00:08:18.800",
      "text": "and spinning around for fun, is a lot"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 497440,
      "end_ms": 500080,
      "start": "00:08:17.440",
      "end": "00:08:20.080",
      "text": "less useful against Sombra because"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 498800,
      "end_ms": 502319,
      "start": "00:08:18.800",
      "end": "00:08:22.319",
      "text": "sometimes she can just hack you through"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 500080,
      "end_ms": 504080,
      "start": "00:08:20.080",
      "end": "00:08:24.080",
      "text": "it. Now, the biggest outplay tool you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 502319,
      "end_ms": 505919,
      "start": "00:08:22.319",
      "end": "00:08:25.919",
      "text": "have is being hard to find on the engage"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 504080,
      "end_ms": 507360,
      "start": "00:08:24.080",
      "end": "00:08:27.360",
      "text": "before you get the slam off. If you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 505919,
      "end_ms": 511720,
      "start": "00:08:25.919",
      "end": "00:08:31.720",
      "text": "watch this fight from Lip's POV, let's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 507360,
      "end_ms": 511720,
      "start": "00:08:27.360",
      "end": "00:08:31.720",
      "text": "see if we can spot where Dong Hack is."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 519200,
      "end_ms": 524839,
      "start": "00:08:39.200",
      "end": "00:08:44.839",
      "text": "Did you catch that? Let's try from"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 521360,
      "end_ms": 524839,
      "start": "00:08:41.360",
      "end": "00:08:44.839",
      "text": "Trong's Pivot."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 531440,
      "end_ms": 538360,
      "start": "00:08:51.440",
      "end": "00:08:58.360",
      "text": "Let's watch from overhead."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 534160,
      "end_ms": 538360,
      "start": "00:08:54.160",
      "end": "00:08:58.360",
      "text": "Enemy spawn roomated."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 541760,
      "end_ms": 545360,
      "start": "00:09:01.760",
      "end": "00:09:05.360",
      "text": "There's absolutely zero way to boop or"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 543839,
      "end_ms": 547760,
      "start": "00:09:03.839",
      "end": "00:09:07.760",
      "text": "hack this jump without just dying to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 545360,
      "end_ms": 549519,
      "start": "00:09:05.360",
      "end": "00:09:09.519",
      "text": "fray spam the neutral. Pretty similar"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 547760,
      "end_ms": 551040,
      "start": "00:09:07.760",
      "end": "00:09:11.040",
      "text": "fight happens 1 minute after. Let's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 549519,
      "end_ms": 554519,
      "start": "00:09:09.519",
      "end": "00:09:14.519",
      "text": "watch Strong's POV and see if we can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 551040,
      "end_ms": 554519,
      "start": "00:09:11.040",
      "end": "00:09:14.519",
      "text": "find Dong Hack."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 559120,
      "end_ms": 562600,
      "start": "00:09:19.120",
      "end": "00:09:22.600",
      "text": "Did you catch that?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 565839,
      "end_ms": 569279,
      "start": "00:09:25.839",
      "end": "00:09:29.279",
      "text": "for one bonus fight. Sometimes the best"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 567680,
      "end_ms": 571600,
      "start": "00:09:27.680",
      "end": "00:09:31.600",
      "text": "piece of micro you can have is just good"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 569279,
      "end_ms": 574600,
      "start": "00:09:29.279",
      "end": "00:09:34.600",
      "text": "aim. Let's watch this fight from AIDS"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 571600,
      "end_ms": 574600,
      "start": "00:09:31.600",
      "end": "00:09:34.600",
      "text": "PV."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 577040,
      "end_ms": 580240,
      "start": "00:09:37.040",
      "end": "00:09:40.240",
      "text": "In conclusion, if you want to get better"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 578800,
      "end_ms": 581600,
      "start": "00:09:38.800",
      "end": "00:09:41.600",
      "text": "at killing people, if you want to get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 580240,
      "end_ms": 584480,
      "start": "00:09:40.240",
      "end": "00:09:44.480",
      "text": "better at dueling people, you need to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 581600,
      "end_ms": 586000,
      "start": "00:09:41.600",
      "end": "00:09:46.000",
      "text": "learn how to outplay them. It's not just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 584480,
      "end_ms": 587680,
      "start": "00:09:44.480",
      "end": "00:09:47.680",
      "text": "about what you're doing with your CDs."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 586000,
      "end_ms": 589200,
      "start": "00:09:46.000",
      "end": "00:09:49.200",
      "text": "It's not just about landing your shots."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 587680,
      "end_ms": 590720,
      "start": "00:09:47.680",
      "end": "00:09:50.720",
      "text": "How are they going to try and outplay"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 589200,
      "end_ms": 592560,
      "start": "00:09:49.200",
      "end": "00:09:52.560",
      "text": "you? And how are you going to be one"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 590720,
      "end_ms": 594160,
      "start": "00:09:50.720",
      "end": "00:09:54.160",
      "text": "step ahead of them? Especially if you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 592560,
      "end_ms": 595920,
      "start": "00:09:52.560",
      "end": "00:09:55.920",
      "text": "a tank or DPS player trying to get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 594160,
      "end_ms": 597440,
      "start": "00:09:54.160",
      "end": "00:09:57.440",
      "text": "better, watch back your own codes from"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 595920,
      "end_ms": 599680,
      "start": "00:09:55.920",
      "end": "00:09:59.680",
      "text": "the enemy POVs of the people that you're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 597440,
      "end_ms": 601440,
      "start": "00:09:57.440",
      "end": "00:10:01.440",
      "text": "jumping on or trying to duel. What are"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 599680,
      "end_ms": 604560,
      "start": "00:09:59.680",
      "end": "00:10:04.560",
      "text": "they doing to you? Did it work? And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 601440,
      "end_ms": 604560,
      "start": "00:10:01.440",
      "end": "00:10:04.560",
      "text": "could you have outplayed it?"
    }
  ]
}
